  "conditions": {
    "node-exporter-isolation": "Pod-network HTTP/1 metrics only; no TLS/web-config, outbound access, Kubernetes/AWS token or privileged network namespace. Host mounts are read-only and process is non-root. Only Prometheus and node-local health probes may connect. Network-namespace collectors are disabled. Optional XML-RPC/TLS collectors remain disabled; host input is administrator-controlled. Potential static call paths remain visible; this is a bounded residual review, not a claim that all reported code is unreachable.",
    "ksm-metrics-only": "Only port/resources arguments and default metrics operation; no gRPC/xDS server, OTel exporter, custom resources, TLS web config or public listener. Only Prometheus may connect; egress is restricted to DNS and the Kubernetes API. Secrets/ConfigMaps are excluded from collectors and RBAC. Read-only non-root workload with bounded resources.",
    "ksm-private-ca": "The API client uses the explicitly projected private Kubernetes CA; system roots and the distrusted public intermediates described by GO-2026-6809 are not used for that connection. No arbitrary API server, root store or TLS web configuration is admitted.",
    "unused-prometheus-server-apis": "Only Thanos sidecar/query/store/compact are in scope, with S3 object storage. No Receive/Ruler, Azure OAuth remote-write configuration, Prometheus config API or remote-read ingestion handler is enabled. Embedded-module findings remain retained; changing components or configuration requires a new review.",
    "internal-thanos-transports": "Only internal Prometheus/Thanos/Grafana endpoints may reach the HTTP/gRPC services. No public service or xDS authentication is enabled. No SSH or arbitrary JWK/OIDC key configuration is consumed. IAM grants only the selected bucket role, metadata fallback is disabled and resources are bounded. Reachable transport paths remain residual risk until upstream dependency fixes.",
    "trusted-metrics-blocks": "No Receive/remote-write ingestion or external block import. Only the selected Prometheus role writes the private project metrics bucket; store/query are read-only and compactor has scoped block deletion. No external/custom compression dictionaries are configured. The dependency finding is not declared unreachable; trusted data, network controls and resource limits bound current exposure."
  },
